fixture bell_stun_takes_the_swing
doc BUILD.md s8, Bell of the Vigil's stun (docs/adr/0015: a stun is a stagger poise did not cause; the Bell's is 30 frames, content). The dummy's swing telegraphs from frame 29 to land on 53 (dummy_swing). A strike on frame 40 lands on 42 and rings: the dummy is stunned, its swing is gone, and nothing hits Ash. Procs resolve with the player's hits, before the enemies'. The stun is 30 frames counted after the enemy's own 2 f of hitstop: it holds from 42 to 73 and the dummy is idle on 74. Ash holds right from frame 43, as in the control, so that Ash stays in the swing's reach despite the side 1 recoil and the absence of a hit is the Bell's doing. Control: bell_stun_takes_the_swing_control.
room test/dummy_swing
option votive_bell_of_the_vigil 10
frames 90
input
  40 attack
  43..70 R
end
expect
  at 29 event.telegraph=1
  at 42 event.hit=1 event.proc=1 event.stun=1 enemy.state=stun
  during 42..73 enemy.state=stun
  at 74 enemy.state=idle
  never 42..89 event.player_hit=1
end
